            ← {id_cargar, chunk_tamaño}
chunk PUT /api/willakuykunata/kutin llamk'achinapaq/{upload_id}/chunk/{offset} <ct bytes>
            ← 204 nisqapi
tukuchiy POST /api/archivokuna/kutichiy/{upload_id}/tukuchiy {plain_blake3}
            ← 201 {willakuy_id, url}
TTL mana tukusqapi: 24 h

