bots.h1_f:
ruway: POST /api/bots {ruraqpa sutin, qhaway_suti, codigo}
          → {bot_id, token, pubkey}
purichiy: ruwaypi (nodo ukhupi corutina) .
      OR hawa (unay-tapukuna /api/bots/{id}/musuqchay, token-auth'd)
